{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/bz9k8w","slideIndex":10,"text":"HIDDEN APPENDIX. Normal slideshow playback skips this slide. Show it manually only if Amber asks about budget after discussing her recurring tasks. These are provisional figures for internal review, not an accepted agreement or final quotation. Website Support follows the earlier $300 five-hour concept. The combined option uses a provisional USD $700 monthly fee for discussion. Confirm the team cost calculation and staffing before offering a final quote. A separate draft proposal records the proposed scope and commercial terms. The combined allowance is fifteen total hours: five technical, eight design/admin, and two coordination/review. Do not promise fifteen production hours plus additional management."}